Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.07,0:00:11.35,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,An item that can cure all diseases, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.96,0:00:22.61,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,With it, maybe I could cure \NMom's Eternal Sleep Disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.31,0:00:27.34,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The Elixir of Life has three ingredients...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.34,0:00:31.89,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I don't have any of them, \Nbut it's obvious where they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.83,0:00:37.51,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That said, it'd be suicide to enter \Nthat castle without getting stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.10,0:00:39.96,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I need to level up more...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.36,0:00:45.48,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I need to get stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.72,0:02:19.33,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,You accept, then?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.33,0:02:21.35,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Things have changed on my end.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.35,0:02:25.54,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'm willing to join you on the nineteen \NC-Rank raids you mentioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.85,0:02:26.91,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.91,0:02:28.77,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Under one condition, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.77,0:02:31.59,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Sure! Whatever you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.78,0:02:35.43,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,You and I will be going in alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.82,0:02:42.47,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,As in... You and I would be the only ones \Nclearing the C-Rank dungeon, Boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.05,0:02:44.60,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.79,0:02:51.44,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,But C-Rank gates require a minimum \Nof eight team members to enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.10,0:02:54.15,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,So we hire people to meet the quota.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.60,0:02:57.62,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The same way Hwang Dongsuk did.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.37,0:03:02.58,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,I-Isn't that... kind of risky?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.07,0:03:04.62,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Think about it this way...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.25,0:03:10.00,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,If it's just the two of us, we can clear \Nthese nineteen raids with no casualties.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.61,0:03:13.54,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,A strike team capable of handling \Nnineteen operations with zero injuries—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.33,0:03:18.43,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,wouldn't that be the perfect thing \Nto impress your dad with?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.87,0:03:20.43,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,I get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.24,0:03:25.94,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Let's do it, Boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.94,0:03:29.08,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,I'll arrange the extra members and the gates!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.50,0:04:10.06,Default,Cha Hae-in,0,0,0,,And how can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.22,0:04:14.98,Default,Scout,0,0,0,,Impressive. But I'd expect nothing less \Nfrom an S-Rank hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.58,0:04:18.98,Default,Scout,0,0,0,,I was waiting for the right moment \Nto approach you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.98,0:04:20.95,Default,Scout,0,0,0,,I hope you'll excuse the \Ninterruption to your training.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.95,0:04:23.43,Default,Scout,0,0,0,,Here is my card.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.09,0:04:35.80,Default,Yoo Myunghan,0,0,0,,It's been over a decade \Nsince the gates appeared,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.47,0:04:39.30,Default,Yoo Myunghan,0,0,0,,and the world's changed at \Na dizzying pace since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.09,0:04:44.47,Default,Yoo Myunghan,0,0,0,,Infrastructure, the economy, \Nthe media, even politics...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.47,0:04:48.02,Default,Yoo Myunghan,0,0,0,,The dungeons have changed all those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.70,0:04:51.94,Default,Yoo Myunghan,0,0,0,,In particular, our infrastructure, \Nthe foundation of everyone's lives,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.94,0:04:55.40,Default,Yoo Myunghan,0,0,0,,can no longer operate without \Nthe resources from dungeons.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.40,0:05:02.87,Default,Yoo Myunghan,0,0,0,,And hunters are the only ones capable of \Nretrieving these vital resources for our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.27,0:05:06.55,Default,Yoo Myunghan,0,0,0,,Those hunters are in turn overseen by
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.55,0:05:10.29,Default,Yoo Myunghan,0,0,0,,the Hunter's Association, \Na public institution.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.17,0:05:15.75,Default,Yoo Myunghan,0,0,0,,The Association takes awakened \Nhunters, grades them for rank,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.75,0:05:18.12,Default,Yoo Myunghan,0,0,0,,registers them, and handles oversight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.63,0:05:21.25,Default,Yoo Myunghan,0,0,0,,They manage the gates \Nthat don't go to auction,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.25,0:05:23.97,Default,Yoo Myunghan,0,0,0,,as well as deal with dungeon breaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.63,0:05:28.73,Default,Yoo Myunghan,0,0,0,,But the Association is nothing more \Nthan a function of the state.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.73,0:05:34.38,Default,Yoo Myunghan,0,0,0,,The vast majority of those vital resources \Nfrom dungeons are collected by
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.80,0:05:38.11,Default,Yoo Myunghan,0,0,0,,the guilds: the businesses who \Nhire out hunters as a service.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.77,0:05:43.82,Default,Yoo Myunghan,0,0,0,,The guilds have become extremely wealthy \Nfrom the dungeon resources they collect.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.46,0:05:49.25,Default,Yoo Myunghan,0,0,0,,Among them, the Hunters Guild, \Nthe White Tiger Guild, the Reaper Guild,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.25,0:05:54.06,Default,Yoo Myunghan,0,0,0,,the Fame Guild, and the Knights Guild \Nare the largest five guilds in the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.73,0:05:58.35,Default,Yoo Myunghan,0,0,0,,They have a functional monopoly \Non dungeon-related profits.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.61,0:06:03.55,Default,Yoo Myunghan,0,0,0,,And I see no reason to sit back \Nand simply let that continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.92,0:06:07.42,Default,Yoo Myunghan,0,0,0,,Especially considering how important \Nthese resources are to everyday life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.42,0:06:11.39,Default,Yoo Myunghan,0,0,0,,Leaving their collection to a group \Nof mercenaries is out of the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.92,0:06:17.19,Default,Yoo Myunghan,0,0,0,,We've contributed so much to this country. \NIt's our responsibility to handle this, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.07,0:06:22.99,Default,Yoo Myunghan,0,0,0,,And the establishment of this guild \Nis crucial to our accomplishing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.10,0:06:25.66,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.19,0:06:31.58,DefaultItalics,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Even if that's true, \Nthere's a lot of risk involved
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.58,0:06:35.42,DefaultItalics,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,in recruiting an S-Rank hunter to act \Nas my brother's business partner...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.42,0:06:38.63,DefaultItalics,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Which isn't the case for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.40,0:06:56.69,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Looks like anything extra I do \Nisn't counted anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.55,0:07:02.69,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It seems that cursed random loot box \Nthat was offered in the secret quest
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.69,0:07:05.47,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,is out of my reach now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.16,0:07:10.78,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I had hoped for an item as valuable \Nas the key to the Demon's Castle...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.17,0:07:14.55,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Wait. There's still the chance that\Nthe regular random loot box
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.55,0:07:19.00,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,could have a key to something like \Nthe instance dungeon from before...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.25,0:07:28.77,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.44,0:07:34.62,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,With my stats as high as they are now,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.62,0:07:37.35,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,three points aren't enough \Nto make a real change anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.03,0:07:40.74,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'd like to level up more efficiently,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.74,0:07:43.82,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,but I have to wait on Jinho \Nfor the C-Rank dungeons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.65,0:07:50.09,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Wait, the penalty zone! \NMaybe if I fight that centipede...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.54,0:07:55.95,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,No. I might have an easier time \Nrunning now, but beating it...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.95,0:07:58.77,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,And there's no guarantee \NI'd get any experience points.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.04,0:08:04.56,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,They need hunters for a D-Rank gate?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.91,0:08:08.17,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The Hunter's Association \Nis forming a strike team...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.54,0:08:11.68,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,which means I wouldn't be \Nable to fight on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.97,0:08:13.25,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Should I say no?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.82,0:08:17.60,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,But I guess it's better than nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.21,0:08:23.81,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,This is frustrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.77,0:08:37.21,Default,Student,0,0,0,,I didn't stand a chance against you, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.81,0:08:41.25,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,I'm just not ready to be \Nbeaten yet. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.71,0:08:46.54,Default,Student,0,0,0,,It's a shame, though. I wish I could've \Nfought you at your best...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.54,0:08:50.78,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Still worried about that? \NIt's been months since I lost my arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.06,0:08:56.11,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,An emergency summons?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.45,0:09:00.01,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Low-ranked hunters get a lot of calls \Nfor what amounts to running errands.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.01,0:09:02.77,Default,Student,0,0,0,,You seriously won't consider retiring, Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.77,0:09:04.25,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Retirement?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.89,0:09:14.33,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,You've got a point. An old man with one arm \Nmissing might not be of much help at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.33,0:09:16.29,Default,Student,0,0,0,,That's not what I meant, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.29,0:09:20.18,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Still, I may have lost an arm, but I survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.18,0:09:22.58,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,My best years are already behind me,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.58,0:09:26.12,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,but I'd like to spend what I have left \Ncontributing to society.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.53,0:09:36.64,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,Looks like I've got my next raid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.65,0:09:39.10,Default,Kim Wife,0,0,0,,Say, honey...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.81,0:09:43.22,Default,Kim Wife,0,0,0,,Isn't it about time you considered \Nsomething other than hunting?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.22,0:09:45.23,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,We're talking about this again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.23,0:09:49.42,Default,Kim Wife,0,0,0,,But it's so dangerous. All those people \Ndied in the raid from before,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.42,0:09:52.93,Default,Kim Wife,0,0,0,,and you only barely survived, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.31,0:09:55.41,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,Well, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.35,0:09:58.20,Default,Kim Eunji,0,0,0,,Daddy! Up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.24,0:10:03.24,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,The thing is, Eunji is starting \Npreschool next year,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.24,0:10:04.78,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,and Eunha will be in middle school.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.78,0:10:06.23,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,We need the money, don't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.23,0:10:07.75,Default,Kim Wife,0,0,0,,That might be true, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.75,0:10:13.72,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,It'll be fine. The Association doesn't send \Nlow-ranked hunters into dangerous dungeons.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.86,0:10:17.68,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,The other time was just an exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.68,0:10:21.41,Default,Kim Wife,0,0,0,,You're right. I'm sorry \Nfor making such a fuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.41,0:10:22.77,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.40,0:10:24.98,Default,Kim Wife,0,0,0,,Be careful, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.60,0:10:27.89,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,You bet! I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.89,0:10:29.01,Default,Kim Eunji,0,0,0,,Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.01,0:10:30.73,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,Yeah? What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.73,0:10:32.91,Default,Kim Eunji,0,0,0,,Daddy, are you strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.91,0:10:34.77,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,You bet I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.77,0:10:38.28,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,I can beat scary monsters, y'know!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.28,0:10:42.66,Default,Kim Eunji,0,0,0,,Wow! You really are strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.40,0:10:45.48,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,You've got some damn nerve.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.13,0:10:50.13,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.13,0:10:53.78,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,I can't believe you stuck me with \Nthat interview. It was a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.78,0:10:57.07,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,I managed to catch it. \NYou made a good impression.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.07,0:10:59.72,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,I found your answers to be quite profound.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.72,0:11:01.60,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,I'm not here for a bunch of empty flattery!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.60,0:11:05.31,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,And I'm pretty sure the interview was \Nmeant to be for you in the first place!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.31,0:11:07.99,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,Well, considering the offer \Nmade to Chairman Go
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.99,0:11:14.27,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,was for a talented hunter of great character \Nwho is dedicated to the job...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.27,0:11:17.46,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,I mean, does that really sound like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.93,0:11:20.24,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,Well, at least you realize \Nhow sketchy you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.49,0:11:25.21,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,Whatever! So, what's this about, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.21,0:11:29.58,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,There's no way you asked me to come over \Njust so I could chew you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.58,0:11:34.63,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,There was something \NI thought you should know...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.63,0:11:39.00,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,Yoojin Construction are getting ready \Nto launch their own guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.00,0:11:42.01,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,I know. They've been trying \Nto make moves in secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.44,0:11:45.13,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,There's been rumors about \Nheadhunting at my guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.13,0:11:49.69,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,I suppose if you already know, \Nthen I wasted your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.69,0:11:53.20,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,And I already know that you knew I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.20,0:11:55.08,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,Can we please cut the crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.44,0:12:00.07,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,I'll ask you one more time. \NWhat's this really about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.71,0:12:08.33,DefaultItalics,Joohee Mom,0,0,0,,You haven't called much lately. \NIs everything goin' okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.86,0:12:09.65,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.65,0:12:11.30,DefaultItalics,Joohee Mom,0,0,0,,How 'bout work?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.73,0:12:14.17,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,Well... fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.17,0:12:19.68,DefaultItalics,Joohee Mom,0,0,0,,You've always been such a scaredy-cat. \NAre you really handlin' being a hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.68,0:12:24.62,DefaultItalics,Joohee Mom,0,0,0,,You're B-Rank, right? I'm sure most folks \Nwould be pretty strong in that case,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.62,0:12:27.68,DefaultItalics,Joohee Mom,0,0,0,,but wouldn't you just be gettin' in the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.02,0:12:30.39,DefaultItalics,Joohee Mom,0,0,0,,You should come back home \Nan' help out with the business.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.39,0:12:31.81,DefaultItalics,Joohee Mom,0,0,0,,Your Pa's worried—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.81,0:12:33.69,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,Quit trying to run my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.50,0:12:37.17,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,I can make my own decisions! \NSo just drop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.17,0:12:38.15,DefaultItalics,Joohee Mom,0,0,0,,What are you—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.05,0:12:47.66,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,I'm just in the way...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.61,0:12:50.62,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.40,0:12:57.45,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,I wanna try a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.38,0:13:30.58,Default,Cha Hae-in,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.41,0:13:35.21,Default,Choi Jong-In,0,0,0,,How can I help you, Hunter Cha Hae-in?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.62,0:13:40.37,Default,Cha Hae-in,0,0,0,,While I was training, I was approached \Nby a scout from Yoojin Construction.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.37,0:13:41.68,Default,Cha Hae-in,0,0,0,,I thought you should know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.64,0:13:50.06,Default,Cha Hae-in,0,0,0,,They're apparently launching a new guild \Nand wanted me to join them as guild master.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.08,0:13:55.96,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,And I assume, since you're telling me this, \Nthat you turned them down?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.96,0:13:58.79,Default,Cha Hae-in,0,0,0,,Right. I refused the offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.25,0:14:02.10,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,That's a relief. Thank you for telling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.10,0:14:04.53,Default,Cha Hae-in,0,0,0,,It's nothing. I was wondering...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.53,0:14:08.71,Default,Cha Hae-in,0,0,0,,I saw President Baek on my way in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.71,0:14:11.00,Default,Cha Hae-in,0,0,0,,What were you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.38,0:14:23.56,FlashbackItalics,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,What do you think about Jeju Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.09,0:14:27.94,Flashback,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,Jeju Island? Why do you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.94,0:14:32.54,Flashback,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,Since the failed raid, \Nthe island has been sealed off,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.54,0:14:35.91,Flashback,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,with only occasional reconnaissance \Ndone from the shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.91,0:14:39.57,Flashback,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,And the public receives a single \Nannual update about any changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.21,0:14:44.68,Flashback,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,People are trying to forget about the island—\Nand the terror it represents.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.04,0:14:47.49,Flashback,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,Yeah, but can you blame them?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.49,0:14:52.47,Flashback,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,Except, no matter how commonplace \Ngates may have become,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.47,0:14:55.48,Flashback,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,or how much I get fawned over as \Nthe "ultimate weapon" of humanity,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.48,0:14:59.59,Flashback,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,I can never forget about that island, \Nor what happened there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.50,0:15:04.84,Flashback,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,I intend on clearing that island \Nin the near future.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.49,0:15:09.84,Flashback,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,And to do that, I need you \Nand the others on the same page.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.84,0:15:15.36,Flashback,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,We must gain strength, gather allies, \Nand sway public opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.36,0:15:18.36,Flashback,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,That's why you arranged for the interview \Nand are training new hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.97,0:15:31.78,Flashback,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,Isn't there something you left \Nbehind on that island, as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.79,0:15:42.06,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,Eunseok... Byung-gu...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.60,0:15:49.48,Default,Man,0,0,0,,Please. I'm begging you...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.97,0:15:52.85,Default,Man,0,0,0,,They have to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.65,0:15:57.14,Default,Song Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'm heading out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.14,0:15:59.44,Default,Song Jinah,0,0,0,,It's a holiday, but you've got work again?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.45,0:16:02.37,Default,Song Jinah,0,0,0,,You keep busy lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.61,0:16:04.65,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.65,0:16:06.02,Default,Song Jinah,0,0,0,,Hard to believe you're the same guy
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.02,0:16:09.69,Default,Song Jinah,0,0,0,,who had to take time off to recover \Nfrom his injuries after every gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.69,0:16:11.45,Default,Song Jinah,0,0,0,,All the training pay off?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.45,0:16:16.19,Default,Song Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Probably. In any case, I'm able \Nto make a steady living now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.19,0:16:17.62,Default,Song Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That's a good thing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.62,0:16:19.69,Default,Song Jinah,0,0,0,,I guess it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.69,0:16:22.15,Default,Song Jinah,0,0,0,,Wait, Jinwoo! What about your stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.15,0:16:24.54,Default,Song Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It'll be fine. I'm heading out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.54,0:16:25.98,Default,Song Jinah,0,0,0,,Wait, hang on...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.05,0:16:31.76,Default,Song Jinah,0,0,0,,It's not like you're making \Na quick trip to the store.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.93,0:16:38.41,DefaultItalics,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,I didn't awaken to a physical power, \Nwhich means my sword
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.41,0:16:40.30,DefaultItalics,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,is useless against magic beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.04,0:16:45.59,DefaultItalics,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,The martial arts I've spent decades on \Nare useless inside of a dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.59,0:16:50.59,DefaultItalics,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,A swordsman like myself gaining magic-focused \Npowers is quite the twist of fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.59,0:16:53.35,DefaultItalics,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,But I'm sure there's a reason for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.76,0:16:58.28,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Are you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.28,0:16:59.75,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Mr. Song?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.75,0:17:03.35,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,I wasn't sure it was you, but it is! Sung!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.35,0:17:04.84,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.84,0:17:07.34,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,I never thought I'd run into you \Nin a place like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.34,0:17:11.90,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,I must say, where'd that \Ngentle-looking boy go?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.90,0:17:14.90,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,How have you changed so much \Nin just a few months?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.73,0:17:17.06,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Plus...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.06,0:17:19.52,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Didn't you lose a leg?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.52,0:17:23.85,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,When I woke up in the hospital, it was back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.85,0:17:25.27,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.27,0:17:30.03,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,There must've been a high-ranked healer \Namong the hunters who came to collect you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.85,0:17:35.08,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Whatever the case, it's a relief seeing \Na young man like yourself has fully healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.08,0:17:36.77,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That's nice of you to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.17,0:17:39.14,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,But, Mr. Song, your arm...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.14,0:17:43.74,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Too much time had passed \Nsince my injury, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.74,0:17:45.53,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,I don't mind, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.53,0:17:49.71,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,You know, someone from the Association \Nhad told me you were alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.71,0:17:51.82,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,It's so good to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.82,0:17:54.26,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,What are you doing here, anyway, Mr. Song?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.26,0:17:57.46,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Answering a summons from the Association. \NIt's supposed to be urgent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.46,0:17:58.97,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,You, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.69,0:18:14.57,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,What a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.13,0:18:17.56,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,This is quite the reunion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.02,0:18:21.41,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,Jinwoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.76,0:18:23.03,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Joohee...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.16,0:18:27.43,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Along with... Mr. Kim and Mr. Kang.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.86,0:18:30.09,DefaultItalics,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,It's only natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.50,0:18:34.93,DefaultItalics,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,We sacrificed Sung in order \Nto escape on that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.54,0:18:41.10,DefaultItalics,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,And I can't blame Kim for being too ashamed \Nto face me, after what he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.40,0:18:46.24,DefaultItalics,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,That said... five survivors from \Nthat tragedy have been reunited.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.24,0:18:47.31,DefaultItalics,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.66,0:18:50.78,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,It really is you, isn't it, Jinwoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.78,0:18:52.95,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,You look like a whole different person!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.95,0:18:54.99,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Yeah. It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.99,0:18:58.12,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,You're so much taller, \Nand your leg is healed...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.55,0:19:00.79,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,I guess you were fine \Nafter I visited you, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.79,0:19:02.38,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,You visited me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.48,0:19:12.09,Default,Prisoner A,0,0,0,,Nice! We got a fine little lady in this group.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.19,0:19:18.09,Default,Prisoner A,0,0,0,,What's up, baby? You and this guy an item?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.72,0:19:20.21,Default,Prisoner A,0,0,0,,You should play with us—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.21,0:19:21.57,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Shut your mouths.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.17,0:19:26.02,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,This outing isn't for recreation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.03,0:19:33.69,Default,Lady Associate,0,0,0,,I'll now brief our regular hunters, \Nif you'd come this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.43,0:19:35.65,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,What's going on here...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.65,0:19:40.13,Default,Lady Associate,0,0,0,,These men are the prisoner substitute \Nhunters who will be joining you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.13,0:19:44.37,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Substitute hunters?! We're supposed \Nto fight alongside criminals?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.37,0:19:47.92,Default,Lady Association,0,0,0,,They are hunter convicts, but they're \Nhere to reduce their sentences
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.92,0:19:49.98,Default,Lady Association,0,0,0,,and are unlikely to cause trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.98,0:19:54.51,Default,Lady Association,0,0,0,,We're short-staffed due to a exodus \Nof local hunters. I hope you'll understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.87,0:19:56.67,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,What a mess...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.13,0:20:01.10,Default,Lady Association,0,0,0,,You'll be accompanied by an overseer from \Nthe Hunter's Association, Kang Taeshik, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.10,0:20:04.05,Default,Lady Association,0,0,0,,He's B-Rank, so even in \Nthe worst-case scenario,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.05,0:20:08.37,Default,Lady Association,0,0,0,,he should be able to handle \Nthree C-Rank criminals with ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.37,0:20:10.10,Default,Lady Association,0,0,0,,Please, rest assured.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.45,0:20:14.60,Default,Song Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I don't know if this is a good idea. \NYou should sit the raid out, Joohee.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.60,0:20:15.82,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,What about you, Jinwoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.57,0:20:17.78,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.23,0:20:23.37,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,Then I am, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.80,0:20:26.08,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.73,0:20:30.67,Default,Prisoner B,0,0,0,,Damn, it's good to be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.94,0:20:34.63,Default,Prisoner C,0,0,0,,We're not slaves here, man. \NIs this kinda thing allowed?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.63,0:20:37.17,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Shut up. You're convicts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.73,0:20:41.43,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,You know what happens if you act up, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.31,0:20:48.65,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,I'm Kang Taeshik, an inspector with the \NHunter's Association Surveillance Team.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.61,0:20:53.92,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,I'll be responsible for them, \Nso you can relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.71,0:20:57.93,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Who's going to take point on the raid today?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.88,0:21:02.46,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Sung... Do you mind if I lead?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.46,0:21:03.74,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,No, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.68,0:21:08.05,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Thank you for giving me this chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.05,0:21:09.16,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,M-Mr. Song?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.59,0:21:13.03,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,On that day, seven people died because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.41,0:21:16.51,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,The magnitude of my failure to protect \Neveryone can not be understated.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.51,0:21:20.10,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,But... six of us did survive, because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.10,0:21:22.84,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,So let me say this, as a \Nrepresentative of the others:
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.48,0:21:25.68,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,I am so grateful to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.34,0:21:28.92,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,You don't have to bow, Mr. Song.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.20,0:21:34.72,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Is it all right with you, as well, Kim?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.00,0:21:38.61,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.28,0:21:49.80,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Well, with that being the case, \NI will take point in the dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.80,0:21:52.67,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Understood. Let's get underway, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.36,0:22:02.13,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Off we go, now...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.53,0:22:05.01,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Into the dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.97,0:23:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,
